# Keep secrets and live SQLite out of devenkalra image builds.
# Build context is the monorepo root (see devenkalra.com/Dockerfile).
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.sqlite3-*
**/*.sqlite-wal
**/*.sqlite-shm
devenkalra.com/backend/db.sqlite3
devenkalra.com/backend/.env
devenkalra.com/backend/media
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/venv
